---
description: Auto-deploy workflow after code changes
alwaysApply: true
---

# Deployment Default

- For this project, automatically deploy after any completed code change without waiting for the user to ask.
- Never leave code changes undeployed at the end of a task unless the user explicitly says not to deploy.
- If a commit is requested, create the commit first, then deploy.
- After deployment, always return both:
  - production/live URL
  - Vercel inspect URL
- If deployment fails, retry immediately and report the blocker plus what was attempted.
